From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:10:51 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: asahi: Build the AOP accelerometer and
 gyroscope driver

Build the AOP motion driver (aop_motion, apple,aop-accel / apple,aop-gyro)
as a module, next to the AOP ambient light and lid angle drivers, so the
J604 accelerometer and gyroscope services enabled in its device tree get a
driver from the official recipe configuration.

(backported from commit f185987448 "arm64: dts: apple: t6040: Add the AOP
accelerometer and gyroscope")

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config b/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
index c66e191491..d8d8eb31f6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
@@ -112,6 +112,7 @@ CONFIG_APPLE_PMP_REPORT=y
 CONFIG_APPLE_PMP_THERMAL=m
 CONFIG_IIO_AOP_SENSOR_LAS=m
 CONFIG_IIO_AOP_SENSOR_ALS=m
+CONFIG_IIO_AOP_SENSOR_MOTION=m
 CONFIG_RUST_FW_LOADER_ABSTRACTIONS=y
 CONFIG_PWM_APPLE=m
 CONFIG_APPLE_AIC=y
